  "id": "tic-douloureux",
  "term": "tic douloureux",
  "definition": "Tic douloureux is trigeminal neuralgia, a condition marked by repeated attacks of extreme facial pain in the area supplied by the trigeminal nerve. The pain lasts for seconds or longer and can be triggered by touching certain spots on the face, lips, or gums, or by facial movement or chewing.",
